      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your inability to see any future despite resting is a classic sign of depression, not just a phase of burnout, and it doesn't mean the way forward is not possible. Reaching out to a mental health professional who can help you untangle the weight you are carrying is a crucial step toward getting the support you need to move forward. You are not alone in this darkness, and there is hope for a life that feels less heavy and more manageable.",
      "source": "target",
