      "content": "Those thoughts about wanting to simply \"stop\" are a dangerous sign that you are in a place where even survival feels like a wrong choice, and I strongly urge you to pause and reach out to a crisis line or a mental health professional immediately because believing your current reality is permanent is a symptom of the illness right now. This feeling of wanting to escape rather than solve isn't a failure on your part, but rather proof of the immense pain you are enduring. Please do not handle this burden alone as it can be as effective as death is at ending suffering.",
